  "name": "Claude Code + Desktop + Helpers — Surge Only (Verified Code IDs)",
  "description": "16 Little Snitch 6 rules for 4 signer identities verified from local codesign output: Claude Code CLI; Desktop; shared Desktop Helpers (regular/GPU/Plugin/Renderer); Desktop iOS Sim. Per identity allow 198.18.0.0/15, 127.0.0.0/8, ::1/128; deny other outgoing destinations. No wildcard paths. Remote subscription may disable new Allow rules despite disabled:false. Must check Network Monitor and rule precedence; cannot cover different-code-ID or unsigned external subprocesses. Little Snitch demo/inactive filter is not reliable protection.",
